libllama-capture: a C API (lc_open / lc_decode / lc_tokenize / lc_info / lc_close) over llama.cpp's common setup
with an eval callback that hands every weight matmul's input (data pointer, type, shape, CUDA ordinal, graph name)
to the caller. ggufrefine.capture.ggml uses it to accumulate input Grams on the GPU from llama.cpp's own graph.

